<section class="sec" id="why">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow reveal">Why now</span>
<h2 class="st reveal">Why SAP SuccessFactors, and <span class="serif">why now.</span></h2>
<p class="lede reveal">Enterprises are moving HR from on-premise SAP HCM to SuccessFactors on a hard clock, and every migration needs Employee Central consultants. HR-minded people who learn configuration step into a cloud consulting career that HCM's sunset keeps feeding.</p>
<div class="why-stats">
<div class="ws reveal"><b>2030</b><span class="t">HCM sunset drives migration</span><p>On-premise SAP HR support windows push thousands of firms to SuccessFactors.</p></div>
<div class="ws reveal"><b>#1</b><span class="t">HR suite in enterprise SAP shops</span><p>Where the ERP is SAP, the HR cloud choice is overwhelmingly SuccessFactors.</p></div>
<div class="ws reveal"><b>HR+</b><span class="t">Tech premium for HR people</span><p>HR professionals with configuration skills out-earn generalist HR sharply.</p></div>
</div>
<h3 class="reveal" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:44px">Why it is a smart move for you</h3>
<div class="diff-grid" style="margin-top:22px">
