<section class="sec" id="faq" style="background:#fff">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow reveal">FAQ</span>
<h2 class="st reveal">The questions people actually <span class="serif">ask.</span></h2>
<p class="lede reveal">If yours isn't here, a counsellor answers it on a 20-minute call.</p>
<div class="faq-wrap">
<div class="acc reveal">
<details open=""><summary>I am from HR, not IT. Can I really become an SF consultant? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">That is the designed path. Employee Central is configured through screens and rules, not code, and your HR process knowledge is precisely what clients pay consultants to have. The course adds the system; you bring the domain.</div></details>
<details><summary>What will I actually configure in this course? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Employee Central end to end: foundation and employee data models, events and workflows, role-based permissions, MDF custom objects, Time Off, and reporting, finished with a full implementation capstone on a live instance.</div></details>
<details><summary>Which certification does this course prepare me for? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">The SAP Certified Associate for SuccessFactors Employee Central Core, the credential EC job posts filter by, with two full mock exams. The exam is booked through SAP and charged separately.</div></details>
<details><summary>What is the starting salary in SuccessFactors? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Associate consultants typically start between Rs 3.5 and 6 lakh. Certified consultants with one implementation reach Rs 6 to 11 lakh, and multi-module seniors climb well beyond.</div></details>
<details><summary>SuccessFactors or SAP FICO: which suits me? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">FICO suits finance minds; SuccessFactors suits people-process minds. If HR, payroll or people operations feel native to you, SF converts that instinct into a technology consulting career.</div></details>
<details><summary>Do I get access to a real SuccessFactors system? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Yes, a live training instance where every module ends in configuration you performed: your capstone workbook and instance become demonstration material in interviews.</div></details>
<details><summary>Is it online or classroom, and is Malayalam support available? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Both. In-person batches in Trivandrum, Kochi and Bengaluru, plus live online batches across Kerala, the GCC and beyond. Sessions are in clear English with Malayalam support.</div></details>
<details><summary>Do you guarantee a job after the course? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">No, and we will not pretend otherwise. We provide structured placement support and real introductions across 400+ partners, with support continuing six months after you finish.</div></details>
</div>
